  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Strengthening local governance, decentralisation and gender mainstreaming in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To provide technical assistance for empowering local governments and other sub-national bodies&lt;/strong&gt; through devolution of political, administrative and fiscal powers, authority and responsibilities from central to local government for planning and implementing public functions; and Supporting institutional capacities for &lt;strong&gt;increased women&#xbf;s participation and greater women&#xbf;s empowerment&lt;/strong&gt; for a more equal and fair local development;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
